        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Infrastructure for pressurised impregnation. Dip treatment would require less steel but about the same land use.\n\n# Included processes\nThe land area and the material (production and disposal) and their transports needed for a preservative treatment plant is included. Land used for the storing of incoming wood is not included because most preservative treatment is done in the sawmills. The space used for drying after the treatment is included.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
